==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep (Enemy Base)|Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep]].
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Enmu]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

